  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your spell effects pass unseen.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Unseen Spell<sup>GCC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Creatures unable to see an unseen spell effect take a -4 penalty on their Reflex save rather than -2, and cannot use evasion or improved evasion against the spell effect. Creatures with uncanny dodge take a -2 penalty on saves and cannot use evasion to avoid the spell’s effects, though creatures with uncanny dodge and improved evasion can treat that ability as evasion.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-metamagic-feats#toc51\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
